# Fonts the launcher's WPF front end needs, as the installer prepares them.
#
# These files are NOT shipped with this project. app.xaml asks for families that no Linux system
# provides ("Segoe UI, Yu Gothic UI, Microsoft YaHei UI" and "Cascadia Mono, Consolas"), and WPF dies
# with FailFast when it cannot resolve any of them. So install.sh takes a free font from the system,
# rewrites its internal family name with rename_font.py and registers the result in the Wine prefix.
#
# registry name in Windows | file to write into the prefix | fontconfig pattern | family to set
Segoe UI (TrueType)|SegoeUI.ttf|Liberation Sans|Segoe UI
Segoe UI Bold (TrueType)|SegoeUI-Bold.ttf|Liberation Sans:bold|Segoe UI
Segoe UI Italic (TrueType)|SegoeUI-Italic.ttf|Liberation Sans:italic|Segoe UI
Segoe UI Bold Italic (TrueType)|SegoeUI-BoldItalic.ttf|Liberation Sans:bold:italic|Segoe UI
Consolas (TrueType)|Consolas.ttf|Liberation Mono|Consolas
Consolas Bold (TrueType)|Consolas-Bold.ttf|Liberation Mono:bold|Consolas
Cascadia Mono (TrueType)|CascadiaMono.ttf|DejaVu Sans Mono|Cascadia Mono
